WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,600
Roujia, what did you think at first, giving the house to your uncle?

2
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:06,360
Everything belongs to classmates, please donate a little

3
00:00:06,560 --> 00:00:08,000
