16
00:00:36,940 --> 00:00:39,540
Do you think of high school seniors as perfect queens?

17
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,300
My choice at the time

18
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:44,100
It was the best choice for me who had a very small vision.

19
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:46,100
If you think it's stupid, then it's stupid

20
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:47,820
I never thought I was right

21
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:51,660
I am just an ordinary person who may not be able to choose the right one after weighing it. If now

22
00:00:51,820 --> 00:00:53,420
I might drop everything and he just ends up

23
00:00:53,740 --> 00:00:54,740
But at that time I

24
00:00:55,060 --> 00:00:56,020
Not who I am now

25
00:00:58,420 --> 00:01:00,220
You said you would donate money to help me, and now I am here too

26
00:01:00,380 --> 00:01:02,340
I'm really short of money. How much do you plan to donate?

27
00:01:02,660 --> 00:01:04,020
I don't have any money either

28
00:01:04,260 --> 00:01:06,900
It’s not easy to be a trainer in the gym now.

29
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:08,740
